{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:32+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:58:32+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Mapfre, S.A.","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Diversified","country":"Spain","city":"Majadahonda","website":"https://www.mapfre.com","employees":30693,"summary":"Mapfre, S.A., together with its subsidiaries, engages in insurance, reinsurance, and financial activities in Spain. The company offers life; health; accident; property and casualty protection that include automobile insurance, homeowner and commercial risk, and family third-party liability insurance; savings and investment; retirement; burial; travel and leisure insurance; and agriculture and livestock insurance products. It also provides investment and pension funds; reinsurance services; insurance for businesses; and business multirisk insurance. The company serves its products to companies, small, medium, and large corporations, as well as to professionals, entrepreneurs, the self-employed, and small businesses. The company was formerly known as Corporacion Mapfre and changed its name to Mapfre, S.A. in December 2006. Mapfre, S.A. was founded in 1933 and is based in Majadahonda, Spain. Mapfre, S.A. operates as a subsidiary of Cartera Mapfre, S.L.","exchange":"MCE","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Mapfre, S.A., avec ses filiales, exerce des activités d’assurance, de réassurance et financières en Espagne. La société offre la vie; la santé; accident; la protection des biens et des accidents qui comprennent l'assurance automobile, le risque propriétaire et commercial, et l'assurance responsabilité civile familiale; l'épargne et l'investissement; la retraite; l'enterrement; l'assurance voyage et loisirs; et l'agriculture et les produits d'assurance du bétail. Il fournit également des fonds d'investissement et de pension, des services de ré